.specdev/assignments/00003_bugfix_jsonl-write-path-integrity/review/brainstorm-reviewer-codex-round-1.log:121:- **Index-driven reads:** Each `.jsonl` file has a companion `.idx` file mapping linekeys to byte offsets for O(1) lookups and range queries
